      "pinyin": "yì tiān yǒu ge lǎo nǎi nai lái wèn tā xiǎo huǒ zi shàng hǎi nán zěn me zǒu",
      "english": "Little Chen was working at the train station."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小陈看老奶奶行动不太方便，",
      "traditional": "小陳看老奶奶行動不太方便，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo chén kàn lǎo nǎi nai xíng dòng bú tài fāng biàn",
      "english": "One day, an old grandma asked him: “Young man, how do I go to Shanghai South?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "就扶着她从贵宾室里走，并一直把老奶奶送上了去海南的火车。",
      "traditional": "就扶著她從貴賓室裡走，並一直把老奶奶送上了去海南的火車。",
      "pinyin": "jiù fú zhe tā cóng guì bīn shì lǐ zǒu bìng yì zhí bǎ lǎo nǎi nai sòng shàng le qù hǎi nán de huǒ chē",
      "english": "Little Chen saw that the old grandma couldn’t move very well, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "结果，老奶奶的孩子在上海南站等了一天也没有接到人。",
      "traditional": "結果，老奶奶的孩子在上海南站等了一天也沒有接到人。",
      "pinyin": "jié guǒ lǎo nǎi nai de hái zi zài shàng hǎi nán zhàn děng le yì tiān yě méi yǒu jiē dào rén",
      "english": ".. so he helped her go through the VIP lounge, and escorted her all the way onto the train going to Hainan."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "As a result, the old grandma’s child waited the entire day at Shanghai South without being able to meet her."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "中文很奇妙，断句的地方不一样，意思就不一样。",
      "traditional": "中文很奇妙，斷句的地方不一樣，意思就不一樣。",
      "pinyin": "zhōng wén hěn qí miào duàn jù de dì fang bù yí yàng yì si jiù bù yí yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "像这个“上海南”，可以理解为“上／海南”，就是“去海南”的意思；",
      "traditional": "像這個“上海南”，可以理解為“上／海南”，就是“去海南”的意思；",
      "pinyin": "xiàng zhè ge shàng hǎi nán kě yǐ lǐ jiě wéi shàng hǎi nán jiù shì qù hǎi nán de yì si",
      "english": "Chinese is very fascinating. Depending on how you separate the words, the meaning will be different."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "也可以理解为“上海／南”，就是“上海南站的简称”。",
      "traditional": "也可以理解為“上海／南”，就是“上海南站的簡稱”。",
      "pinyin": "yě kě yǐ lǐ jiě wéi shàng hǎi nán jiù shì shàng hǎi nán zhàn de jiǎn chēng",
      "english": "Like this “Shang Hai Nan”. It can be understood as “Shang / Hainan”, meaning “Go to Hainan”;"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "老奶奶想去上海南站，但小陈理解成了老奶奶想去海南，",
      "traditional": "老奶奶想去上海南站，但小陳理解成了老奶奶想去海南，",
      "pinyin": "lǎo nǎi nai xiǎng qù shàng hǎi nán zhàn dàn xiǎo chén lǐ jiě chéng le lǎo nǎi nai xiǎng qù hǎi nán",
      "english": "It can also be understood as “Shanghai / Nan”, an abbreviation for “Shanghai South Station”."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "结果好心帮了倒忙。",
      "traditional": "結果好心幫了倒忙。",
      "pinyin": "jié guǒ hǎo xīn bāng le dào máng",
      "english": "The old grandma wanted to go to Shanghai South Station, but Little Chen thought she wanted to go to Hainan."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
